&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Testcontainers 1.20.6 Docker Engine 29-এর সাথে অসংগত&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;বল্যাপান Testcontainers 2.0.5 + prefix`testcontainers-*`+ resolutionStrategy vs Spring Boot BOM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
