&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;ফাংশন`let`এটিগeneral&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; No.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
